{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Iron and copper.</b> These are the sinews and the bones, which are a lock for the body like a lock for a door — for through the oil that he will have, he will be constantly anointed, and his sinews and bones will be strengthened as though they were iron and copper, and this is:</b>" "<b>And as your days, so your old age.</b> Like the days of your youth shall be the days of your old age, as Rabbi Chanina said: ״The hot water and oil that my mother anointed me with in my childhood stood by me in my old age.״"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "The note ends with וזהו ('and this is') without completing the thought; translated as it stands."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:05.736783942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}